{
  "_comment": "可选字段：listenHost 省略 = 绑定全部网卡（保持现状）；启用 shutdownEndpoint=true 时建议 listenHost=127.0.0.1，并由反向代理 deny /shutdown（反代转发后源地址为 loopback，会绕过 loopback 校验）。",
  "machineId": "<machine-id>",
  "launcher": { "port": 3100, "idleStopMs": 300000, "startupCheck": true, "startupCheckTimeoutMs": 120000, "shutdownEndpoint": false },
  "projects": [
    {
      "_comment": "可选：A2A push 回调能力（按机器/项目 opt-in，默认不开启）。将 agentConfig.agentCard.pushNotifications 设为 true 即对本项目开启；缺省或写 false = 不开启（沿用轮询对账）。回调 url/token 无需在此配置——由 orch 经 A2A message/send 的 configuration.taskPushNotificationConfig 内联下发，故无需改 ensure 或线协议。仅限同机/受信网络使用；跨机回调鉴权待 v0.7.0。",
      "projectId": "<project-id>",
      "workspace": "<absolute path to the project on this machine>",
      "agentKind": "opencode",
      "a2aPort": 3010,
      "risk": "write",
      "agentConfig": { "agentCard": { "pushNotifications": false } }
    },
    {
      "projectId": "<codex-project-id>",
      "workspace": "<absolute path to the codex project on this machine>",
      "agentKind": "codex",
      "a2aPort": 3011,
      "risk": "write"
    },
    {
      "projectId": "<claude-project-id>",
      "workspace": "<absolute path to the claude project on this machine>",
      "agentKind": "claude",
      "a2aPort": 3012,
      "risk": "read"
    }
  ]
}
